#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:15
msgid ""
"The original deployment record does not specify driver, image or backend versions. "
"Confirm a compatible combination for your environment before using this "
"configuration."
msgstr "原始部署記錄沒有註明驅動、映象或後端版本。使用此配置前，請確認環境中的版本組合相容。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:18
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置條件"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:20
msgid ""
"Install the MetaX driver and Docker on the host. Check that all three device paths "
"listed above exist and choose the appropriate Enterprise image."
msgstr "在宿主機安裝沐曦驅動與 Docker，檢查上述三個裝置路徑均存在，並選擇適用的企業版映象。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:23
msgid "Start the container"
msgstr "啟動容器"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:25
msgid ""
"Replace the image placeholder with your MetaX Enterprise image. The shared-memory "
"allocation below is the value from the deployment record; size it for the host and "
"workload."
msgstr "將映象佔位符替換為所用的沐曦企業版映象。下面的共享記憶體大小來自部署記錄，請按宿主機與工作負載調整。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:27
msgid "Container startup"
msgstr "容器啟動"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:44
msgid "Container parameters"
msgstr "容器引數"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:48
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "引數"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:49
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:50
msgid "``--network host``"
msgstr "``--network host``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:51
msgid "Use host ports directly without port mapping."
msgstr "直接使用宿主機埠，無需埠對映。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:52
msgid "``--device``"
msgstr "``--device``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:53
msgid "Expose the DRI, physical-memory and MetaX compute devices."
msgstr "對映 DRI、實體記憶體和沐曦計算裝置。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:54
msgid "``--group-add video``"
msgstr "``--group-add video``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:55
msgid "Grant access through the video group."
msgstr "透過 video 使用者組授予訪問許可權。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:56
msgid "``--shm-size=128g``"
msgstr "``--shm-size=128g``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:57
msgid "Configure the container's shared-memory limit."
msgstr "配置容器共享記憶體上限。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:58
msgid "``--security-opt``"
msgstr "``--security-opt``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:59
msgid "Use the seccomp and AppArmor settings from the recorded configuration."
msgstr "使用記錄中的 seccomp 和 AppArmor 配置。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:60
msgid "``--ulimit memlock=-1``"
msgstr "``--ulimit memlock=-1``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:61
msgid "Remove the locked-memory limit."
msgstr "移除鎖定記憶體的上限。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:62
msgid "``--restart unless-stopped``"
msgstr "``--restart unless-stopped``"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:63
msgid "Restart after an unexpected stop, except when manually stopped."
msgstr "意外停止後自動重啟，手動停止時除外。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:66
msgid "Persistent model storage"
msgstr "模型持久化儲存"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:68
msgid ""
"Add these options to the container command to keep downloaded models on the host. "
"Replace the host path with an existing directory."
msgstr "將以下選項加入容器啟動命令，把下載的模型儲存在宿主機上。請將宿主機路徑替換為已存在的目錄。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:76
msgid "Start and verify the service"
msgstr "啟動並驗證服務"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enter the container, replace the host placeholder with the machine's reachable "
"address, and start the web entry and inference service."
msgstr "進入容器，將地址佔位符替換為本機可訪問的地址，然後啟動 Web 入口與推理服務。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/hardware/metax.rst:85
msgid ""
"Check the container logs, access the web interface on port 8091 and launch a model. "
"Validate actual inference output as well as API availability."
msgstr "檢查容器日誌，訪問 8091 埠的 Web 介面並啟動模型。除 API 可用性外，還需驗證實際推理輸出。"

